      "tool_calls": 2,
      "answer": "The monthly interest is calculated in the paragraph 1300-COMPUTE-INTEREST. The interest rate is retrieved from the DISCGRP-FILE in the paragraph 1200-GET-INTEREST-RATE. The interest is computed as follows: \n\n1. The interest rate is read from the DISCGRP-FILE (lines 415-440).\n2. The monthly interest is calculated using the formula: \n   `WS-MONTHLY-INT = (TRAN-CAT-BAL * DIS-INT-RATE) / 1200` (lines 464-465).\n3. The monthly interest is added to the total interest (line 467).\n4. The transaction is written (line 468).\n\nThe exact interest rate used in the calculation is determined from the DISCGRP-FILE, and if the default group code is used, the default interest rate is retrieved (lines 436-440).",
      "citations": [
        {
